    (4, None, '\'Well, thank goodness, I was worrying intensely.\' "Slava bogu", "glory to God", is the Russian "thank goodness", the one Alisa quoted from her mother. "Volnovalas" has the woman\'s -las, so it\'s Vika speaking.'),
